[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2879968763","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106391#issuecomment-2879968763","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106391","id":2879968763,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rqNX7","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T12:10:46Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T12:10:46Z","body":"> I just don't understand why we don't just use `Localized` as default\r\n\r\nFor properties that are mainly used for being set in the editor, I think it does make more sense to use Localized by default. Examples include particle-related properties.\r\n\r\nHowever, other more commonly used properties such as `texture`, `visible`, `position`, and `flip_h` often need to be accessed in code. Defaulting to Localized is more likely to result in a discrepancy between a property's display name and its actual name. Remembering what these English names do is an essential part of the introductory process for beginners, and there's no way to skip it.\r\n\r\nBesides, using Localized by default makes it difficult to follow existing tutorials. Most Godot tutorials on the internet are in English. Using Chinese as an example, we have a large amount of subtitle-translated video tutorials on Bilibili (a site like YouTube). It's unrealistic to expect translators to translate the property names in the videos, not to mention translating the terms the same way they appear in the editor.\r\n\r\nI think using Localized by default does make the Inspector more newbie-friendly. However, it also increases the learning burden for beginners and makes most tutorials more difficult to follow.\r\n\r\nUntil we go through another breaking update like 4.0 that invalidates existing learning resources, I don't think we should consider making Localized the default setting.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2879968763/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880009048","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106391#issuecomment-2880009048","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106391","id":2880009048,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rqXNY","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T12:19:13Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T12:19:13Z","body":">  using Localized by default makes it difficult to follow existing tutorials.\r\n\r\nI can't stress this point enough. Pretty much no Godot tutorials translate properties","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880009048/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880025195","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106391#issuecomment-2880025195","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106391","id":2880025195,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rqbJr","user":{"login":"SheepYhangCN","id":44539204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTM5MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44539204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN","html_url":"https://github.com/SheepYhangCN","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T12:25:05Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T12:25:05Z","body":"> Remembering what these English names do is an essential part of the introductory process for beginners, and there's no way to skip it.\r\n\r\nPutting the cursor on it, and there goes the tooltip\r\nBesides, if users use GDScript, won't snake case makes more sense?\r\n\r\n> Besides, using Localized by default makes it difficult to follow existing tutorials. Most Godot tutorials on the internet are in English.\r\n\r\nIt's common in many other game engines like GameMaker (they made a garbage Chinese localization)\r\nFull localized engine won't be a blocker since users can get the raw name in tooltip and documentation\r\nI don't think we should keep compatibility with tutorials rather than keep full localized\r\n\r\n\r\nbtw, here is a real thing happened:\r\nI invited a friend to start using Godot\r\nThe first question he asked me is why he got full English inspector\r\nAnd I have to point where to change `default_property_name_style`\r\nAnd he was curious why is this feature in Advanced Settings and default to non-localized","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880025195/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880046231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106391#issuecomment-2880046231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106391","id":2880046231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rqgSX","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"ht