ollowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SheepYhangCN/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T12:35:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T12:35:42Z","body":"> Do Unity and Unreal have localized properties?\r\n\r\nI never used Unreal\r\nAnd I only used Unity for some localization work for other unity games (like, generating fonts y'know)\r\nAnyways, here is the result in Unity 6\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91fc2b23-ce04-4e5c-af83-f7b205f9ecaa)\r\nYes, localized","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880056613/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3016261691","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106391#issuecomment-3016261691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106391","id":3016261691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zyIA7","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_ur